---
// src/components/AdvisorVsPortalSection.astro
// Establishes the value of a real IRDAI-certified advisor over aggregator portals
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 via-white to-blue-50/40 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-blue-100/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 relative">
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-4">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
        Why Work With an Expert
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Portal vs. Advisor: Where Do You Go When a Claim Fails?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Aggregator portals compare prices well. But when your claim gets rejected — they can't fight for you. Here's the real difference.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <!-- Portal Side -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden reveal">
        <div class="bg-slate-100 px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            Online Aggregator Portal
          </h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✗</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-800">Chatbots & call centers.</strong> You're ticket #48291. No one remembers your name.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✗</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-800">No claim help.</strong> Their job ends when you buy. Rejected claim? You're on your own.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✗</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-800">Generic recommendations.</strong> Algorithms rank by commission, not your family's actual risk profile.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✗</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-slate-800">Zero accountability.</strong> A faceless platform — no one to call, no one to blame, no one to fight for you.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Advisor Side -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-900 to-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
        <div class="bg-white/10 border-b border-white/10 px-6 py-4 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
            Hari Kotian — IRDAI Certified Advisor
          </h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-blue-100/90 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">A real person.</strong> 25+ years in insurance. You talk to Hari directly, not a bot.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-blue-100/90 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Claim fighter.</strong> Rejected claim? We appeal, escalate to IRDAI, and recover ₹50Cr+ for families.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-blue-100/90 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Tailored advice.</strong> Every policy recommendation is matched to your family, health, and budget — not an algorithm.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-blue-100/90 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white">Lifetime support.</strong> Same advisor from purchase to claim to renewal. 1000+ families served, 4.2★ rated.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="px-6 pb-6">
          <a href="/contact" class="block w-full text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-amber-500 text-slate-900 font-bold py-3.5 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-500/25 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
            Talk to Hari — Free Consultation
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
